802
00:54:06,285 --> 00:54:07,320
- Or when they pull a door open . - Yes .

803
00:54:07,369 --> 00:54:10,157
But with the doors in this film , you just have to slide them open .

804
00:54:10,247 --> 00:54:14,161
So the actors can close or open them really fast , or they can stand

805
00:54:14,293 --> 00:54:18,708
